WEBVTT

00:07.757 --> 00:08.925
Going on a mission?

00:11.010 --> 00:12.137
It's you, Kocho.

00:12.721 --> 00:14.848
I've got some news about demons.

00:14.931 --> 00:17.809
They said our compatriots
who were sent there were brutally killed.

00:17.892 --> 00:20.103
Some civilians have fallen victim too.

00:20.186 --> 00:21.479
I can't let that be.

00:22.188 --> 00:24.315
Could it be the Twelve Demon Moons?

00:24.399 --> 00:25.775
I'm afraid so.

00:25.859 --> 00:27.610
Probably the Upper Moons.

00:27.694 --> 00:29.904
That looks like a challenging task.

00:29.988 --> 00:33.491
Since you're going there alone,
I don't see the need to worry.

00:34.492 --> 00:35.410
Kocho.

00:35.493 --> 00:38.246
What are your plans
with that headbutt boy under your care?

00:38.747 --> 00:41.124
You suggested
that we seek more successors,

00:41.207 --> 00:43.251
but you don't seem
to be taking him in as one.

00:43.334 --> 00:47.380
It's not like I'm going to eat him,
so don't worry about that.

00:47.464 --> 00:48.798
Of course you won't.

00:54.471 --> 00:55.889
Take care.

02:33.236 --> 02:35.071
No!

02:35.155 --> 02:37.574
I can't swallow it!

02:37.657 --> 02:39.742
I had to put up with this every day.

02:39.826 --> 02:42.245
You came here
critically injured, Mr. Zenitsu,

02:42.328 --> 02:44.122
so take your medication now.

02:47.250 --> 02:48.626
Goodness.

02:48.710 --> 02:50.879
Here is your medication, Mr. Tanjiro.

02:51.421 --> 02:52.380
Here you go.

02:52.463 --> 02:53.464
Thank you.

02:57.677 --> 03:00.555
Hey, Tanjiro's medication
is easy to swallow!

03:00.638 --> 03:02.849
I was right.
It's different from mine, right?

03:02.932 --> 03:06.019
You're being biased here. You're biased!

03:06.102 --> 03:09.439
Zenitsu, this is a hospital,
so you must keep it down.

03:09.522 --> 03:10.857
You're doing really well.

03:11.608 --> 03:13.276
DESTROY

03:13.359 --> 03:15.153
Mr. Murata!

03:15.236 --> 03:16.195
Hi.

03:19.032 --> 03:20.783
I'm glad that you're all right.

03:20.867 --> 03:24.829
My body was almost dissolved,
but I was pretty lucky.

03:24.913 --> 03:27.707
I heard that you're severely injured?

03:27.790 --> 03:30.126
It will take a while to heal.

03:30.752 --> 03:33.171
You've lost your voice,
didn't you, wild boar guy?

03:34.505 --> 03:36.257
What's wrong with him?

03:37.050 --> 03:40.511
He has been through a lot,
so you'd better leave him alone.

03:40.595 --> 03:43.097
But why is he so dispirited
all of a sudden?

03:43.181 --> 03:44.224
Tanjiro!

03:44.933 --> 03:47.227
Who's this guy?

03:47.310 --> 03:50.521
He's Mr. Murata who fought with us
at Natagumo Mountain.

03:50.605 --> 03:52.649
I'm Murata. Nice to meet you.

03:52.732 --> 03:54.776
Your arm…

03:54.859 --> 03:56.527
I almost turned into a spider.

03:56.611 --> 03:59.239
My arms and legs became short.

03:59.322 --> 04:01.658
That's why you must take your medication!

04:02.617 --> 04:04.285
But it tastes so bad.

04:04.369 --> 04:06.496
It's much worse than what I could stand!

04:06.579 --> 04:09.540
If your arms don't heal,
it's none of my concern!

04:09.624 --> 04:12.043
The chills!
Your words sent chills down my spine!

04:12.126 --> 04:13.878
You have no idea how lucky you are.

04:13.962 --> 04:16.547
Only by taking your medication
and spending more time in the sun,

04:16.631 --> 04:18.883
you'll shed your residual effects.

04:18.967 --> 04:21.427
I don't want to!

04:21.511 --> 04:24.597
I don't want anything that tastes bad!

04:25.181 --> 04:27.141
You seem to have a great time.

04:27.225 --> 04:28.393
Mr. Murata?

04:28.935 --> 04:32.188
I was called to the Hashiras' meeting

04:32.272 --> 04:34.732
to give a detailed report
on the Natagumo incident.

04:35.233 --> 04:36.776
It was hell.

04:36.859 --> 04:39.237
The Hashiras are really scary.

04:39.320 --> 04:42.824
They said that our former members
are so atrociously undertrained,

04:42.907 --> 04:44.826
it made us tremble in fear.

04:44.909 --> 04:46.452
They also pointed out

04:46.536 --> 04:50.081
that some of us were disobedient
in the Natagumo mission.

04:50.164 --> 04:53.918
They started asking us
who their trainers were.

04:54.002 --> 04:58.339
For someone of my rank
to hear such things from them…

05:00.091 --> 05:02.927
The Hashiras are scary.

05:03.511 --> 05:04.637
Hello.

05:05.888 --> 05:07.724
A Hashira! Lady Kocho.

05:07.807 --> 05:08.808
Hello.

05:08.891 --> 05:10.810
Good day to you. Goodbye!

05:11.811 --> 05:14.147
I see. Goodbye.

05:15.273 --> 05:17.567
Are you feeling any better?

05:18.234 --> 05:20.236
I'm much better already.

05:20.778 --> 05:24.907
Then it's almost time
for your rehabilitation training.

05:25.658 --> 05:28.161
Rehabilitation training?

05:28.244 --> 05:29.662
Yes.

05:29.746 --> 05:31.706
Sorry for being too weak.

05:32.415 --> 05:33.541
TWO WEEKS LATER

05:33.624 --> 05:37.503
Tanjiro and Inosuke were taken away
by the Hashira, Ms. Shinobu,

05:37.587 --> 05:40.006
to commence their rehabilitation training.

05:41.132 --> 05:44.385
Ms. Shinobu has a pleasantly unique voice

05:45.011 --> 05:47.096
that gave me a feeling
I never felt before.

05:47.847 --> 05:50.725
It's so out of this world
that it's a little creepy.

05:50.808 --> 05:54.270
But in restoring those
who turned into spiders,

05:54.353 --> 05:55.813
she was like a goddess.

05:55.897 --> 05:59.317
Everyone shed tears of joy
as they approached her.

06:00.151 --> 06:03.071
Besides that, she was extremely adorable.

06:03.154 --> 06:05.114
She could live through a day
with just a smile.

06:05.907 --> 06:10.787
As they followed such an adorable figure
to undergo their rehabilitation training,

06:10.870 --> 06:12.955
I guess Tanjiro and Inosuke
are pretty much…

06:13.039 --> 06:14.749
MIRROR

06:16.292 --> 06:18.461
They came back with that look.

06:19.670 --> 06:21.672
Welcome back, Tanjiro, Inosuke.

06:22.632 --> 06:24.425
How did it go today?

06:26.177 --> 06:27.762
What happened?

06:27.845 --> 06:29.388
Tell me, what's up with you guys?

06:30.139 --> 06:31.182
Sorry.

06:31.974 --> 06:33.434
Leave me alone.

06:34.102 --> 06:35.853
Just tell me!

06:35.937 --> 06:39.690
I may be a little late,
but I'll have my training tomorrow!

06:42.777 --> 06:44.821
THE NEXT DAY

06:46.864 --> 06:48.825
I'm scared.

06:49.659 --> 06:51.577
I don't want to go.

06:52.161 --> 06:55.832
Thus, Mr. Zenitsu
will commence training today.

06:55.915 --> 06:58.209
Allow me to go through this one more time.

06:58.793 --> 07:00.128
First, you go there.

07:00.211 --> 07:02.130
Since your body has turned stiff
and bedridden,

07:02.213 --> 07:03.756
those girls will help you with it.

07:09.512 --> 07:11.097
Next, it's reflex training.

07:11.722 --> 07:14.434
There's tonic in these cups.

07:15.017 --> 07:17.353
You will splash it on your opponent.

07:17.437 --> 07:21.774
If your opponent stops you
before you raise your cup,

07:21.858 --> 07:23.401
you can't move it.

07:25.653 --> 07:26.571
Begin.

07:27.238 --> 07:28.156
Again.

07:28.865 --> 07:29.740
Begin.

07:31.325 --> 07:32.326
That's all.

07:33.161 --> 07:35.455
Last but not least,
it's full-body training.

07:35.538 --> 07:37.999
Or in simple terms, playing tags.

07:38.624 --> 07:41.836
Me, Aoi, and my assistant, Kanao,
will be your opponents.

07:44.839 --> 07:47.175
Excuse me, can we take a time-out?

07:48.259 --> 07:50.261
Is there something you're not clear about?

07:50.344 --> 07:52.054
No, I have something to take care of.

07:52.138 --> 07:53.598
Come here, you two.

07:54.265 --> 07:55.475
I'm not coming.

07:56.142 --> 07:59.145
I told you to come, didn't you hear me?

08:00.688 --> 08:01.772
Come on!

08:01.856 --> 08:05.818
Follow me, you pieces of scum!

08:05.902 --> 08:07.403
What are you up to?

08:09.780 --> 08:12.200
Now kneel for me. Kneel up straight!

08:12.283 --> 08:14.118
You idiots!

08:14.202 --> 08:15.745
What are you trying to do?

08:18.498 --> 08:19.749
Inosuke!

08:22.043 --> 08:23.753
How could you, Zenitsu?

08:23.836 --> 08:25.338
Apologize to Inosuke now!

08:28.508 --> 08:29.842
It's you who should apologize to me!

08:29.926 --> 08:31.010
Both of you, apologize to me!

08:31.093 --> 08:34.472
You were both in heaven,
yet you act like you were in hell!

08:34.555 --> 08:37.016
You've been playing around
with girls every day.

08:37.099 --> 08:39.352
Then you come back to me
like you're half-dead. Why?

08:39.435 --> 08:40.811
Both of you apologize to me!

08:40.895 --> 08:43.314
I want you to stab yourselves!

08:43.397 --> 08:44.774
What are you talking about?

08:44.857 --> 08:46.901
Shut up, you broad-headed old fogey!

08:46.984 --> 08:48.903
Shut up when I'm speaking!

08:49.862 --> 08:53.199
You would flirt with girls here,
they would massage you,

08:53.282 --> 08:55.159
and stroke your fingers
while playing cups!

08:55.243 --> 08:58.120
They could even touch you
while playing tags!

08:58.204 --> 09:02.291
Each girl has a pair of tits,
a pair of butt cheeks, and a pair of legs!

09:02.375 --> 09:04.210
They smell so good
when you brush past them!

09:04.293 --> 09:06.504
You should've enjoyed it
only by seeing them, okay?

09:07.880 --> 09:10.925
You're blessed, so blessed!

09:11.008 --> 09:13.678
Can you stop rambling like a total idiot?

09:13.761 --> 09:17.682
I lost to someone smaller than me,
so I was demoralized.

09:17.765 --> 09:19.183
How pathetic you are!

09:19.267 --> 09:21.310
You never got along with a girl,
did you, Inosuke?

09:21.394 --> 09:23.646
You were raised in the wild,
so you're such a late bloomer!

09:23.729 --> 09:25.898
You're pitiful!

09:25.982 --> 09:27.275
I'm so pissed!

09:27.358 --> 09:28.484
What was that?

09:28.568 --> 09:31.070
I stepped on a mother's child before!

09:31.153 --> 09:32.572
You're so terrible!

09:32.655 --> 09:33.573
You're annoying!

09:33.656 --> 09:34.949
Nobody likes you!

09:36.033 --> 09:38.744
I can have as many girls as I want!

09:40.997 --> 09:42.915
I'm at your service now!

09:52.383 --> 09:54.176
See? I'm doing fine.

09:54.260 --> 09:56.887
This is one hell of a guy.

09:56.971 --> 09:59.515
I would be crying in pain if that were me,

09:59.599 --> 10:00.975
but he's so happy.

10:02.435 --> 10:04.103
I am your opponent.

10:05.062 --> 10:06.105
Begin.

10:08.733 --> 10:11.819
I don't spill tea on girls.

10:17.033 --> 10:19.118
Up next, full-body training.

10:19.201 --> 10:20.036
Begin.

10:21.037 --> 10:22.121
Take this!

10:23.164 --> 10:25.583
I won on the outside, but lost inside.

10:26.125 --> 10:28.044
Now it's my turn.

10:28.127 --> 10:29.337
Take this!

10:29.420 --> 10:31.255
-Got you!
-That hurts!

10:32.256 --> 10:35.051
Only I lost all the way through.

10:35.134 --> 10:36.260
How embarrassing.

10:38.304 --> 10:39.221
But…

10:39.722 --> 10:41.265
there's no beating Kanao.

10:41.932 --> 10:45.478
None of us could stop her
from holding up a cup

10:45.561 --> 10:47.146
or hold our own cup against her.

10:48.356 --> 10:52.318
In the past five days,
I lost to Kanao every time.

10:53.653 --> 10:54.695
Same goes to Inosuke

10:55.863 --> 10:56.947
and Zenitsu.

10:57.657 --> 11:01.035
We couldn't even lay a finger
on a single strand of her hair.

11:01.994 --> 11:04.914
And then, those two
stopped coming for training.

11:05.873 --> 11:08.000
Zenitsu, Inosuke!

11:10.878 --> 11:12.129
Show me the ropes!

11:16.008 --> 11:18.135
I appreciate your hard work.

11:22.473 --> 11:24.475
Why can't I beat her?

11:25.059 --> 11:26.936
What does she have that I don't?

11:27.520 --> 11:30.689
First, her reflex is way faster than mine.

11:30.773 --> 11:33.943
Even if I'm at my very best,
I'd probably still lose to her.

11:34.026 --> 11:36.028
Her scent is also different.

11:36.529 --> 11:38.948
-It's similar to that of a Hashira.
-Mr. Tanjiro.

11:39.532 --> 11:41.742
Also, her eyes.

11:41.826 --> 11:44.286
-Her eyes are also different.
-Mr. Tanjiro.

11:44.370 --> 11:45.704
Excuse me.

11:45.788 --> 11:48.707
Mr. Tanjiro, are you all right?

11:48.791 --> 11:51.127
We have called you many times.

11:51.210 --> 11:53.087
I'm sorry, I didn't hear you.

11:53.170 --> 11:54.213
What is it?

11:57.341 --> 11:58.592
Your towel.

11:59.718 --> 12:01.846
Thank you very much!

12:01.929 --> 12:03.180
You're so kind.

12:04.640 --> 12:05.558
Excuse me.

12:05.641 --> 12:10.563
Do you use Total Concentration Breathing
all the time, Mr. Tanjiro?

12:12.273 --> 12:18.404
Do you use it in the morning, afternoon,
evening, and even when you sleep?

12:19.363 --> 12:20.614
No.

12:20.698 --> 12:22.074
I never went that far.

12:22.825 --> 12:25.202
Is that even possible?

12:25.286 --> 12:26.454
Yes.

12:26.537 --> 12:31.041
Whether or not you can do it
will make a whole world of difference.

12:31.667 --> 12:33.878
If you only use
Total Concentration Breathing a little,

12:33.961 --> 12:35.963
you'll get tired very easily.

12:36.547 --> 12:38.716
Using it all day…

12:39.216 --> 12:42.094
Someone has already managed
to pull it off.

12:42.178 --> 12:45.097
All the Hashiras and Ms. Kanao can do it.

12:45.181 --> 12:47.183
-You can do it too!
-You can do it too!

12:47.266 --> 12:48.309
I see.

12:48.934 --> 12:49.977
Thank you.

12:50.060 --> 12:51.103
I'll give it a try.

12:53.898 --> 12:56.942
It's almost time for training, Inosuke.

12:58.569 --> 13:01.280
Sitting around moping isn't going to help.

13:01.989 --> 13:03.574
Same goes to you, Zenitsu.

13:04.909 --> 13:07.286
No, I think I've done enough.

13:07.786 --> 13:09.914
Tell them that my injury is getting worse.

13:09.997 --> 13:11.749
The nurse at that corner over there,

13:11.832 --> 13:13.751
care to join me for a cup of tea?

13:21.050 --> 13:22.927
Total Concentration Breathing.

13:23.677 --> 13:28.891
I said I'd try to pull it off through day,
night, and during bedtime.

13:31.519 --> 13:33.395
But I can't do it at all.

13:33.479 --> 13:35.147
I can't!

13:35.231 --> 13:37.983
I have to totally concentrate my breath
all the time

13:38.067 --> 13:39.985
and it's messing me up.

13:40.069 --> 13:41.570
I can't take it.

13:41.654 --> 13:43.364
My lungs and ears are hurting.

13:43.447 --> 13:45.741
I can feel the thumping in my ears.

13:45.824 --> 13:47.034
My eardrums.

13:50.704 --> 13:52.790
I'm freaking out!

13:52.873 --> 13:57.127
I thought my heart
is going to pop out of my ears.

13:57.211 --> 14:00.089
I can't do it at this rate.

14:00.172 --> 14:02.258
When you're in trouble,
you must go back to square one.

14:03.175 --> 14:04.677
This is all for nothing!

14:10.599 --> 14:12.226
I must breathe with my lungs.

14:12.851 --> 14:16.105
If I can't even do that,
that means my lungs are weak.

14:16.772 --> 14:18.023
I must do my best.

14:18.107 --> 14:20.234
I've got to do my best.

14:20.317 --> 14:21.819
That's what I've been doing.

14:22.611 --> 14:24.822
I gain through effort every day.

14:25.406 --> 14:28.659
Even if it bears a little fruit,
I'll work hard to make progress.

14:28.742 --> 14:29.660
Here I go!

14:30.494 --> 14:33.706
Mr. Tanjiro is working hard every day.

14:33.789 --> 14:36.625
Yes, let's make him some rice balls.

14:36.709 --> 14:38.878
Good idea. Not to mention…

14:40.129 --> 14:41.714
Blow a gourd?

14:42.423 --> 14:43.507
Yes.

14:43.591 --> 14:46.010
When Lady Shinobu trained Ms. Kanao,

14:46.093 --> 14:49.513
she always made her blow these.

14:49.597 --> 14:50.723
What?

14:52.016 --> 14:53.893
That sounds like fun.

14:53.976 --> 14:56.228
Does the gourd make sounds?

14:56.312 --> 14:57.438
No.

14:57.521 --> 15:00.900
You must blow it until it breaks.

15:00.983 --> 15:02.234
Okay.

15:02.818 --> 15:03.944
Until it breaks?

15:05.154 --> 15:06.780
This thing?

15:08.490 --> 15:11.035
-This rock-solid thing?
-Yes.

15:11.118 --> 15:13.829
This gourd is special.

15:13.913 --> 15:16.415
It's harder than most gourds.

15:16.916 --> 15:20.794
Even a petite girl like her
can break a gourd just by blowing it?

15:20.878 --> 15:24.256
The size of the gourd slowly changed too,

15:24.840 --> 15:28.135
but Ms. Kanao managed
to blow it until it broke.

15:29.678 --> 15:31.138
This is the gourd.

15:31.221 --> 15:32.765
It's so big!

15:32.848 --> 15:33.849
I'll do my best!

15:34.516 --> 15:35.434
THE NEXT DAY

15:35.517 --> 15:37.144
Are they taking a break today too?

15:37.227 --> 15:38.604
I'm sorry.

15:38.687 --> 15:40.606
I'll take them here tomorrow.

15:40.689 --> 15:42.191
Sorry about that.

15:42.274 --> 15:45.736
Never mind. You can let them be.

15:46.403 --> 15:47.613
I'll do my best.

15:48.238 --> 15:49.323
I'll do my best!

15:51.325 --> 15:54.411
I'll perform my training
as imparted by Master Urokodaki

15:54.954 --> 15:57.665
and practice my Total Concentration
Breathing at the same time.

15:57.748 --> 15:59.750
Just like when I used to run downhill,

15:59.833 --> 16:01.877
I'd run laps around the Butterfly Estate

16:01.961 --> 16:06.131
and treat the obstacles
as the trees on the mountain.

16:06.215 --> 16:07.216
Harder!

16:08.884 --> 16:11.303
Harder!

16:11.387 --> 16:13.472
Harder!

16:14.098 --> 16:15.015
FIFTEEN DAYS LATER

16:15.099 --> 16:16.684
I've regained much of my strength.

16:17.726 --> 16:20.270
Now I can run as fast as I used to.

16:20.354 --> 16:22.481
My lungs have gotten more robust.

16:22.564 --> 16:23.899
It feels so good.

16:24.483 --> 16:29.196
I run laps in the day
to train my lungs with fast movement.

16:29.279 --> 16:30.698
Now I have to slowly

16:31.281 --> 16:33.617
take a deep breath.

16:33.701 --> 16:36.120
Let the oxygen flow into my fingertips.

16:36.870 --> 16:39.039
"Meditation improves concentration."

16:39.957 --> 16:41.750
That's what Master Urokodaki said.

16:43.419 --> 16:44.712
Master Urokodaki?

16:45.379 --> 16:49.133
I can't believe you broke my blade!

16:49.800 --> 16:51.176
I'm sorry.

16:51.885 --> 16:54.930
I wish you could make me
a new one, Mr. Haganezuka.

16:55.014 --> 16:56.890
I'm terribly sorry.

16:58.726 --> 17:00.978
Concentrate. Concentrate on my spirit.

17:01.061 --> 17:03.022
I must concentrate my spirit and breath.

17:03.105 --> 17:04.606
Hello?

17:04.690 --> 17:06.150
Hello?

17:06.233 --> 17:07.693
Hello?

17:07.776 --> 17:09.153
Hello?

17:09.236 --> 17:11.655
-Yes!
-You've been working hard.

17:14.116 --> 17:17.411
I wonder where your friends are now.

17:19.872 --> 17:21.999
Don't you feel lonely?

17:22.499 --> 17:23.459
No.

17:23.542 --> 17:26.962
If I can pull this off,
I can teach them how to do it.

17:28.088 --> 17:30.424
You have a sincere heart.

17:34.678 --> 17:35.929
By the way,

17:36.013 --> 17:39.308
why did you bring us here?

17:40.309 --> 17:43.729
Everyone now knows that Nezuko is a demon.

17:44.438 --> 17:47.357
Besides, you were critically injured.

17:49.359 --> 17:50.861
Besides that,

17:50.944 --> 17:54.948
I'd like to pass on my dream to you.

17:55.908 --> 17:57.034
Dream?

17:57.117 --> 17:58.077
Yes.

17:59.203 --> 18:01.371
A dream for humans and demons
to coexist in peace.

18:01.955 --> 18:03.874
I believe that you can make it happen.

18:11.590 --> 18:12.966
Are you angry?

18:14.468 --> 18:17.304
I always get that scent of anger from you.

18:17.888 --> 18:19.556
Even when you are smiling.

18:23.602 --> 18:24.770
Is that so?

18:25.562 --> 18:26.730
You're right.

18:27.397 --> 18:29.983
Perhaps, I'm always angry.

18:31.235 --> 18:34.279
Ever since my beloved sister
lost her life to a demon,

18:35.697 --> 18:39.952
every time I see someone weep
as demons kill their beloved,

18:41.703 --> 18:43.997
and every time I hear cries of despair,

18:45.290 --> 18:49.837
anger keeps building up inside me
little by little.

18:50.963 --> 18:53.382
Deep down inside me,

18:53.465 --> 18:55.676
lies a sense of hatred
that is hard to release.

18:56.885 --> 19:00.013
I think the same goes
for the other Hashiras.

19:01.849 --> 19:07.396
But now they've seen Nezuko,
a demon that won't eat people.

19:07.479 --> 19:09.273
They must have noticed her scent.

19:10.023 --> 19:12.276
There's also Lord Oyakata's order.

19:12.359 --> 19:15.279
I guess they won't lay a finger
on Nezuko anymore.

19:20.909 --> 19:23.954
My sister was a gentle person
just like you.

19:25.330 --> 19:27.207
She was sympathetic to demons.

19:28.000 --> 19:31.336
She even felt pity for demons
at the brink of her death.

19:32.880 --> 19:35.340
I, on the other hand, never felt that way.

19:36.216 --> 19:38.927
Why should we pity anyone
who kills people?

19:39.011 --> 19:41.180
There's nothing stupider than that.

19:42.431 --> 19:43.807
But…

19:43.891 --> 19:46.268
since that's what my sister wanted,

19:46.351 --> 19:47.936
I have to move on with my life.

19:48.896 --> 19:52.357
If there is a way out of this
without killing the poor demons,

19:52.441 --> 19:54.109
then I must keep thinking it out.

19:55.235 --> 19:58.572
I have to preserve my sister's smile.

19:59.907 --> 20:01.033
Kanae!

20:02.784 --> 20:04.036
Kanae!

20:05.078 --> 20:06.455
Kanae!

20:08.624 --> 20:11.710
But I'm a little tired.

20:13.754 --> 20:15.672
Demons are full of deception.

20:16.590 --> 20:19.843
They'd give up their sense of reason
to protect themselves.

20:20.510 --> 20:23.096
They kill people with bare instinct.

20:26.808 --> 20:27.851
Tanjiro.

20:28.352 --> 20:29.770
Please do your best for me.

20:30.604 --> 20:32.731
You must do your best to protect Nezuko.

20:34.733 --> 20:38.028
The moment I thought
that you could work for me,

20:38.737 --> 20:40.364
I felt peace in my mind.

20:41.114 --> 20:42.658
It lightened my mood.

20:46.828 --> 20:49.331
You stopped your Total Concentration
Breathing, didn't you?

20:57.256 --> 20:58.465
I'll do my best.

20:59.508 --> 21:01.093
Total Concentration Breathing.

21:05.889 --> 21:07.724
Mom. Hanako.

21:08.225 --> 21:11.061
Takeo. Shigeru. Rokuta.

21:14.106 --> 21:17.901
I promise I'll have Nezuko
turned back into human.

22:52.829 --> 22:54.790
Did you find something delightful,
Ms. Shinobu?

22:54.873 --> 22:55.707
Yes.

22:55.791 --> 22:57.751
I've obtained a highly-prized medicament.

22:58.376 --> 22:59.419
Are you angry?

22:59.503 --> 23:02.380
Someone stole the pastry
I kept inside my cabinet.

23:02.464 --> 23:04.091
You're sad now, aren't you?

23:04.174 --> 23:06.176
The mountain is in sixes and sevens.

23:06.718 --> 23:08.929
Here's a little gossip
from the Taisho era.

23:09.012 --> 23:11.556
Since Ms. Aoi trained under Ms. Shinobu,

23:11.640 --> 23:14.267
I heard that she can even concoct
some simple medications.

23:14.351 --> 23:17.729
You really have a keen
sense of smell, Tanjiro. I'm impressed.

23:18.230 --> 23:22.192
-Well…
-I'm glad to talk with you.

23:22.275 --> 23:23.944
Thank you.

23:24.027 --> 23:27.489
Next, episode 25,
"Tsuguko, Kanao Tsuyuri."

23:27.572 --> 23:28.782
TO BE CONTINUED

23:28.865 --> 23:30.158
Subtitle translation by CL Tan
